      "path": "/projects/0/description",
      "value": "RESPOND is a Computer-Aided Dispatch (CAD) application built to reduce crime and enable rapid response across the city. When a citizen calls 112 (police emergency number), the call is registered as an event in the system. This event is then dispatched by a controller, who assigns a First Responder (vehicle) to the location for immediate action including call volumes and response status.",
